{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"平\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"平\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：两版大字内容和出现顺序完全相同，主线理解持平；core：两版都清楚呈现了维护尊严与怀念旧日生活、亲近关系之间的反复拉扯，没有明显偏离。small、fine：X更多用具体的身体反应和有辨识度的生活意象补充感受，如“胸口还堵着团棉花”“故乡傍晚的炊烟”，Y则有较多解释性、概括性的表达，部分小字与大字意思重叠。concise：X虽然文字较长，但不同感受之间有区分；Y多次重复大字已经表达的意思，如“不甘心就这样垮下去”“争累了”“害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了”。human：Y的“往前的步子还没聚起来”“心脏以最高负荷剧烈跳动”“不再困在原地的停滞里”等搭配不够自然，带有生硬的概括腔；X整体口语表达和意象衔接更顺。load：两版大字数量、长度、切分和出现时间完全一致，因此判平。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "79243913-752f-4e0e-886d-d18e88c5a8fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T201922273354Z", "elapsed_seconds": 169.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:22:12.001886+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "41e31c0fbf5b2a6a8e63e045e6201bad09b0cdc6ec4fddd3bdc70cd4a704313e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e